its, otakus, and ditzes. But in reality they are handpicked experts. They take their own private war back to Mars to face the harsh reality that life may not always be like a Giant Mecha Series.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Space","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Parody","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space Opera","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Food","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":35,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Martian Successor Nadesico","english":"Martian Successor Nadesico","native":"機動戦艦ナデシコ","romaji":"Kidou Senkan Nadesico","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰抚子号"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰大和抚子"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"機動戰艦"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}